# Incinerator of the Guilty: "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, you may collect evidence X. When you do,
# this creature deals X damage to each creature and planeswalker that player controls." X is chosen as the ability resolves
# (CR 107.3f), and the cards exiled from your graveyard must have total mana value X or greater (CR 701.59a).
# Turn 1: Black Lotus, Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl and a Mountain make {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{W} for the Dragon. Turn 2: Bot2 casts Ajani
# Resolute (loyalty 2), Savannah Lions (2/1) and a Lightning Bolt at Bot1, so its graveyard holds a Bolt too. Turn 3: Bot1 casts
# its own Ajani and bolts Bot2, so its graveyard holds Black Lotus (0) and Lightning Bolt (1): X = 2 is refused (Bot2's Bolt is not
# its evidence), X = 1 exiles the Bolt. Each of Bot2's creatures and planeswalkers takes exactly 1: the Lions die and its Ajani
# is left at loyalty 1, while Bot1's own Ajani and Incinerator are not touched. Bot2 took 6 and the Bolt.

